# Run from the repo root, after kanto_gym_rematch.py.
# Johto route trainers, ported from Pokemon Crystal (same route trainers as HG/SS): 104 trainers on
# Routes 26-27, 30-46, Ilex Forest, National Park and Lake of Rage, with their Crystal dialogue.
#  - Levels: scaled for postgame Johto, ramping along the HG/SS route order (Lv 55 on Route 30 up
#    to Lv 76 on Routes 26-27). Each Pokemon line is the Crystal one, evolved to fit the level.
#    Default level-up moves; Cooltrainers use the advanced AI.
#  - Positions: Crystal's spot when the map is the same size, otherwise scaled to this map and
#    moved to the nearest open, reachable tile (water for swimmers). Fine-tune in Porymap.
#  - New trainer constants TRAINER_JOHTO_* follow the last existing trainer; NUM_TRAINERS grows.
#  - Each route's scripts.inc gets the battles and texts after a "Johto route trainers" marker.
